        "TileImage": "$($repository c4c4af69-5bec-4f64-8488-45762f15137b).Image",
        "Description": "Looks like we&apos;ll need to bounce to Haven again. Parker and Walker are both rich CEO&apos;s who have made their fortune from cryptocurrency and trafficking of various assets. Bella is a skilled Kamera fatale agent, and as Walker&apos;s mistress, is assigned as his escort. Finally is Murphy, Kamera technician, hacker, operative and computer genius. He has been using Haven&apos;s servers and network to launch Kamera cyber attacks via encrypted VPN&apos;s and the such. I trust you&apos;ll be sensible with this one, 56.\r-V",
